<div class="stats"><div><b>10+</b><span>Projects</span></div><div><b>12+</b><span>Tech</span></div><div><b>∞</b><span>Chai ☕</span></div><div><b>100%</b><span>3D 😎</span></div></div>
</div>
<div class="scene" id="scene">
<div class="photo-3d" id="photo3d"><div class="ring3d"></div><img src="https://github.com/pawardhiraj23.png"></div>
<div class="cube-wrap"><div class="cube"><div class="face f1">HTML 🔥</div><div class="face f2">CSS 🎨</div><div class="face f3">JS ⚡</div><div class="face f4">PYTHON 🐍</div><div class="face f5">REACT ⚛️</div><div class="face f6">ML 🤖</div></div></div>
<p style="color:#a1a1aa;font-size:13px">👆 Ha Cube firtoy - Mazi Skills!</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="marquee"><span>🧊 DHIRAJ PAWAR • 3D DEVELOPER • REACT • PYTHON • ML • FLIP CARDS • 3D CUBE • 3D BACKGROUND • CHILL VIBES • 🔥</span></div>

<div class="section reveal" id="about"><h2>About Me 😎🧊</h2><p class="sub">3D madhe pan same - Chill!</p><p style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.8">Mi Dhiraj Pawar - Pimpri cha mulga. Mala boring websites nako. Website ughadli ki manus mhanela pahije - <b style="color:#facc15">"Wahh! 3D ahe yaar!"</b> Code + Creativity + 3D = Dhiraj Style 💜</p></div>

