<div class="skill-card"><h3>💻 Frontend King</h3><p>HTML / CSS - 95%</p><div class="skill-bar"><div style="width:95%"></div></div><p>JavaScript / React - 88%</p><div class="skill-bar"><div style="width:88%"></div></div><p>Tailwind / Next.js - 85%</p><div class="skill-bar"><div style="width:85%"></div></div></div>
<div class="skill-card"><h3>🤖 Backend + ML</h3><p>Python - 90%</p><div class="skill-bar"><div style="width:90%"></div></div><p>Node.js - 82%</p><div class="skill-bar"><div style="width:82%"></div></div><p>Machine Learning - 80%</p><div class="skill-bar"><div style="width:80%"></div></div></div>
</div></div>

