<div class="flip"><div class="flip-inner"><div class="flip-front"><h3>🧠 Screen Addiction Prediction</h3><p>ML model - screen time, sleep, study baghun addiction predict karto.</p><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">ML</span><p class="hint">👉 Mouse ne - Mage bagh!</p></div><div class="flip-back"><h3>🧠 Details</h3><p>Dataset clean kela, Model train kela, Accuracy 88%+<br>Students cha digital life sudharayla.</p><p style="margin-top:12px;font-weight:800">🔥 BHARI PROJECT</p></div></div></div>
